Regression testing for prediction of peak wage: 
I tested the relationship between age, white vs non-white, college-educated, and women vs non-women. 
I filtered the dataset by- ages 25-65 and working full-time (above 35 hrs in this case).

Regressions to compare: 
1. m1 <- lm(INCWAGE ~ AGE + I(AGE^2), data = acs_fulltime) where acs_fulltime = hours worked > 35
2. m2 <- lm(INCWAGE ~ AGE + I(AGE^2), data = acs_college) where acs_college = college and adv degree = 1

